n desire and speed of resource consumption. <br><br>FloCity is about energy, mass and time.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345960/extras/f54a8f406e483220ef43e8949b1fa49c.avif?t=1752099902\" /></span>",
